{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And the sense of \"when I came from Paddan\":</b> She died suddenly, and I could not bring her to her grave in the cave as I buried Leah. And he said this to Joseph: let it not be grievous to you that I ask of you what I did not do for the honor of your mother."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:48:13.564009800Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}